\`\`\`

## 🔐 Security Configuration

### Secrets Management

- Environment Variables
- HashiCorp Vault

### Security Tooling

- Dependabot (dependency updates)
- CodeQL (GitHub)

### Authentication

- OAuth 2.0
- JWT (JSON Web Tokens)

### Data Handling & Compliance

- Encryption at Rest

### Auth Providers

- GitHub
- Google

### Compliance

- GDPR

### Analytics & Telemetry

- Plausible

### Additional Security Notes

Rotate keys yearly.

